    "reviews": "IGN: 8.5/10 - &quot;Stylish and engaging, Closure\u2019s thoughtful and pensive approach to the puzzle genre should be applauded.&quot;<br><br>1-UP: A- - &quot;The game is crammed with challenges and collectibles that will hold your attention well passed the expiration date of most downloadable titles.&quot;<br><br>Joystiq: 4/5 - &quot;Closure offers up a unique puzzle experience set in a wonderfully moody environment caught somewhere between the designs of Dan Paladin and Edward Gorey.&quot;",
